# Cuberto Slider — a 0..100 slider whose picker grows while dragged and whose purple balloon trails it on a spring, tilting toward the picker and showing the value.
# What this test covers: starting at 0, a slow drag to the middle, overshooting the right end (clamped to 100),
# overshooting the left end (clamped to 0), a fast back-and-forth drag series that makes the balloon spring lag and
# swing, a quick tap on the picker (press-in/out springs only), and releasing mid-drag then resuming from the clamped value.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/cuberto-slider"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 40000
wait 1000
is exists "value=\"0\""
# Slow drag from 0 to roughly the middle.
gesture pan 51 437 150 0 700
wait 800
# The picker now sits near x=171; drag far past the right end.
gesture pan 171 437 225 0 500
wait 1200
is exists "value=\"100\""
# Drag far past the left end.
gesture pan 351 437 -345 0 500
wait 1200
is exists "value=\"0\""
# Quick tap on the picker: only the grow/shrink springs run.
press 51 437
wait 600
# Fast drags: the balloon spring lags far behind and swings; a fast fling stops short of the end at a
# position that varies run to run, so afterwards sweep the track left to right to drive the picker to 100.
gesture pan 51 437 340 0 150
wait 1000
gesture pan 330 437 -280 0 150
wait 1000
gesture pan 60 437 280 0 150
wait 1500
gesture pan 51 437 345 0 300
gesture pan 81 437 315 0 300
gesture pan 111 437 285 0 300
gesture pan 141 437 255 0 300
gesture pan 171 437 225 0 300
gesture pan 201 437 195 0 300
gesture pan 231 437 165 0 300
gesture pan 261 437 135 0 300
gesture pan 291 437 105 0 300
gesture pan 321 437 75 0 300
gesture pan 351 437 45 0 300
wait 1200
is exists "value=\"100\""
gesture pan 351 437 -345 0 500
wait 1200
is exists "value=\"0\""
# Partial drag, release, then grab it again where it stopped and drag past the left end.
gesture pan 51 437 100 0 400
wait 1200
gesture pan 145 437 -120 0 400
wait 1500
is exists "value=\"0\""
wait "label=\"Close\"" 3000
press "label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
